                  },
                  {
                      "image":  "res://assets/cinematics/kael_prologue/images/09_crimson_clash.png",
                      "caption":  "Beneath the thunder of steel, countless voices begged for a tomorrow that would never come.",
                      "duration":  6.0,
                      "zoom":  1.065,
                      "pan_x":  -6,
                      "pan_y":  -1
                  },
                  {
                      "image":  "res://assets/cinematics/kael_prologue/images/01_kael_dreamscape.png",
                      "caption":  "Yet somewhere beyond the reach of time, their cries were still being heard.",
                      "duration":  6.0,
                      "zoom":  1.055,
                      "pan_x":  -5,
                      "pan_y":  1
                  },
                  {
                      "image":  "res://assets/cinematics/kael_prologue/images/10_knights_last_stand.png",
                      "caption":  "They did not fight for glory. They fought for the chance to return to those who loved them.",
                      "duration":  6.0,
                      "zoom":  1.06,
                      "pan_x":  5,
                      "pan_y":  0
                  },
                  {
                      "image":  "res://assets/cinematics/kael_prologue/images/13_mothers_last_embrace.png",
                      "caption":  "What greater cruelty is there than giving someone a world, only to watch that world take everything away?",
                      "duration":  6.5,
                      "zoom":  1.055,
                      "pan_x":  -3,
                      "pan_y":  0
                  },
                  {
                      "image":  "res://assets/cinematics/kael_prologue/images/15_kael_pained_sleep.png",
                      "caption":  "Why does it hurt so much to remember something you have never lived?",
                      "duration":  6.5,
                      "zoom":  1.075,
                      "pan_x":  -2,
                      "pan_y":  0
                  },
                  {
                      "image":  "res://assets/cinematics/kael_prologue/images/12_fallen_battlefield.png",
                      "caption":  "History would remember the battle. But who would remember the lives that ended there?",
                      "duration":  6.0,
                      "zoom":  1.06,
                      "pan_x":  7,
                      "pan_y":  0
                  },
                  {
                      "image":  "res://assets/cinematics/kael_prologue/images/14_tragic_embrace.png",
                      "caption":  "No victory could return what was taken. No prayer could undo the silence.",
                      "duration":  6.5,
                      "zoom":  1.065,
                      "pan_x":  2,
                      "pan_y":  -2
                  },
                  {
                      "image":  "res://assets/cinematics/kael_prologue/images/11_last_stand_sunset.png",
                      "caption":  "Perhaps the cruelest fate was not to perish alongside them... but to remain.",
