                      "zoom":  1.055,
                      "pan_x":  0,
                      "pan_y":  0
                  },
                  {
                      "image":  "res://assets/cinematics/kael_prologue/images/19_kael_awakening.png",
                      "caption":  "And when the dream finally ended, the grief remained.\n\nWhat if it had never been a dream at all?",
